FILE: vUX-toolTip.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
ToolTip registered three delegated listeners inside createTipElement() and mutated every
member element (moving 'title' into 'data-tempTitle', adding the 'vtip' class). None of
it could be undone. destroy() now detaches the three handlers, removes the injected tip
box and the generated 'toolTipStyles-<className>' sheet, and hands each member its
original 'title' attribute back, so a page that tears the tooltip down is left with the
markup it started with.

